  "bodyHash": "858372f70210de1f",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nvb-uy/cdn/main/desc/hysteria/header.png\" alt=\"Hysteria 主視覺圖\" width=\"1125\" height=\"378\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/prominence\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=f2eca1&labelColor=363636&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"205\" height=\"26\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<em><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/SUPPORTS-IRIS, OCULUS, OPTIFINE | 1.7 to 1.21-f2eca1?style=for-the-badge&logo=CurseForge&labelColor=363636&logoColor=white\" width=\"385\" height=\"28\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252felocindev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ElocinDev-SUPPORT ME-f2eca1?style=for-the-badge&logo=Ko-Fi&labelColor=363636&logoColor=white\" width=\"212\" height=\"27\"></a></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">一款風格化、具氛圍感的恐怖主題 Iris 著色器包，擁有高自訂性與優異效能。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">《<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/insanity-shader\" rel=\"nofollow\">Insanity Shader</a>》的現代繼承作</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">基於 Photon，Hysteria 提供了與 Insanity 非常相似的體驗，</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">但加入了現代化功能，如體積雲與霧氣、彩色光照、遠地平線支援等！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://github.com/nvb-uy/cdn/blob/main/desc/hysteria/familiar_yet_different.png?raw=true\" alt=\"熟悉卻不同的樣貌；煥然一新的 Insanity\" width=\"1125\" height=\"186\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://github.com/nvb-uy/cdn/blob/main/desc/hysteria/comparison_day.png?raw=true\" alt=\"白天時段 Insanity Shader 與 Hysteria Shader 的比較\" width=\"1125\" height=\"650\"><img src=\"https://github.com/nvb-uy/cdn/blob/main/desc/hysteria/comparison_night.png?raw=true\" alt=\"夜晚時段 Insanity Shader 與 Hysteria Shader 的比較\" width=\"1125\" height=\"650\"><img src=\"https://github.com/nvb-uy/cdn/blob/main/desc/hysteria/comparison_nether.png?raw=true\" alt=\"地獄中 Insanity Shader 與 Hysteria Shader 的比較\" width=\"1125\" height=\"650\"><img src=\"https://github.com/nvb-uy/cdn/blob/main/desc/hysteria/comparison_end.png?raw=true\" alt=\"終界中 Insanity Shader 與 Hysteria Shader 的比較\" width=\"1125\" height=\"650\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://github.com/nvb-uy/cdn/blob/main/desc/hysteria/features.png?raw=true\" alt=\"特色功能\" width=\"1125\" height=\"114\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🧟&nbsp;<strong>充滿氛圍的恐怖風格。</strong>&nbsp;完美搭配恐怖與殭屍模組包！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">📓&nbsp;<strong>高度可自訂的著色器設定。</strong> 突破 Photon 的限制並進一步擴展。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">⛈️ <strong>沉浸式動態天氣系統。</strong>&nbsp;每日景色各異，雲層與色彩皆隨之變化。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌫️ <strong>體積霧與雲層。</strong> 包含地面與遠景霧氣、動態變化的體積雲，以及更多效果！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌎 <strong>支援 Distant Horizons（遠地平線）。</strong>&nbsp;實驗性功能！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">📝<strong>&nbsp;使用者友善的選單。</strong>&nbsp;內含快速設定選單，提供直覺易用的調整選項。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">💻&nbsp;<strong>相容於多數現代電腦。</strong>&nbsp;針對低階顯示卡進行優化，效能甚至優於 Insanity！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🔦&nbsp;<strong>出門記得帶火把。</strong>&nbsp;不僅夜晚漆黑一片，地獄與終界的黑暗更是令人絕望！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>🌎 廣泛的版本相容性。</strong>&nbsp;支援 1.7.10 及以上所有新版 Minecraft。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">☀️ <strong>內建彩色光照。</strong>&nbsp;支援 labPBR 資源包。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;由 ElocinDev 以 🖤 打造</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://github.com/nvb-uy/cdn/blob/main/desc/hysteria/credits.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"114\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Sixthsurge</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">製作 Photon（Hysteria 的基礎著色器包）</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Capt Tatsu</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\">製作</span>&nbsp;BSL，並協助我開啟 Insanity 的開發。若沒有 Insanity，就不會有 Hysteria！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://github.com/nvb-uy/cdn/blob/main/desc/hysteria/serverbanner.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"201\"></p>",
